'''Mistralton Tower''' (Japanese: '''フキヨセタワー''' ''{{tt|Fukiyose|Mistralton}} Tower'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive landmark in the [[Unova]] [[region]]. It is located along {{rt|7|Unova}}. [[Wishing Bell Festival|A festival]] is held in its honor as well as a contest. Those who win the contest will have a chance to ring the bell at the top of the tower and make their potential wishes come true.

In ''[[BW069|Climbing the Tower of Success]]'', {{Ash}}, [[Stephan]], and [[Ricky]] race to the top of the tower holding {{p|Litwick}}-shaped candles to win the grand prize in the [[Wishing Bell Festival]]. The tower itself has an extremely long spiral staircase inside, and several [[Pokémon]] inside, such as Litwick and {{p|Frillish}}. It is unknown, however, whether these Pokémon are wild or belonging to a {{pkmn|Trainer}}.

It is nearly identical to the [[Celestial Tower]] in design and location. However, it is not a cemetery for {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} as it is in the games.

